        "slc_a1b8b194ff1853d4f2deeb0fe31fc021aed204305b8f3000cff261b8e6e3df75"
      ],
      "text": "A background daemon, repomond, owns SQLite, file watchers, the git layer, and the agent runtime, exposing a JSON-RPC API over a Unix socket or Windows named pipe; desktop, TUI, and iOS clients are thin clients over that API."
    },
    {
