      ],
      "text": "The workspace is split into crates: repomon-core (data model, gix git layer, SQLite store, watchers, usage ledger, agent runtime), repomon-daemon, repomon-tui, repomon-mcp, repomon-host, and a Tauri desktop app."
    },
