        "slc_f2af8a609472cf88baeda06d226a58a9f3c5b85e03972222aff1f14fa814558b"
      ],
      "text": "Default supervision policy auto-approves only repo-scoped command_exec and file_write dialogs; network, credential, deletion, push, install, device, and unknown classes default to hold, and nothing auto-denies out of the box."
    },
