        "slc_6f0ec843015ee052662b3f7dc32d4560a4a35af644b069c57b651fb1f738c3b6"
      ],
      "text": "A hardcoded always-escalate veto (force pushes, rm -rf-shaped deletions, git reset --hard, git clean -f, sudo rm) overrides any policy, including explicit auto_approve mappings and learned rules."
    },
