  "summary": "Selected evidence records: A background daemon, repomond, owns SQLite, file watchers, the git layer, and the agent runtime, exposing a JSON-RPC API over a Unix socket or Windows named pipe; desktop, TUI, and iOS clients are thin clients over that API. The workspace is split into crates: repomon-core (data model, gix git layer, SQLite store, watchers, usage ledger, agent runtime), repomon-daemon, repomon-tui, repomon-mcp, repomon-host, and a Tauri desktop app.",
